# Cursor already skips .gitignore paths and a default list (node_modules,
# lockfiles, images). Listed again so a window that misses .gitignore still
# cannot open them. The generated client stays readable; it is indexing-ignored.
# See the workspace doc docs/agent-workflow.md.

node_modules/
dist/
coverage/
playwright-report/
test-results/
.turbo/
*.tsbuildinfo
package-lock.json

# Secrets
.secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Tracked screenshots. Do not open the whole gallery.
docs/assets/
